WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:11.280
I'm not afraid of apples anymore!

00:13.990 --> 00:14.960
Foolish.

00:14.960 --> 00:18.920
The same trap won't work on me
over and over again.

00:19.300 --> 00:20.920
You said that...

00:28.330 --> 00:30.550
But you've already fallen
for that trap nine times.

00:30.920 --> 00:33.760
It's all right now!
Let's go, everyone.

00:33.760 --> 00:35.340
Watch out, Pearl!

00:40.080 --> 00:41.560
Respawn.

00:42.190 --> 00:45.160
Why do apples fly toward the sky?!

00:45.160 --> 00:47.650
Where's the law of gravity?!

00:51.600 --> 00:52.640
Stop!

00:55.790 --> 00:58.660
I can clearly feel the danger from there.

00:58.660 --> 01:02.220
The more I look at it, the more I think
something's going to jump out at me.

01:04.120 --> 01:05.390
There's nothing here.

01:05.390 --> 01:06.250
Huh?

01:06.670 --> 01:09.940
A killer apple that makes it look like
there's nothing to be afraid of.

01:09.940 --> 01:12.880
And now there is a big hole
that looks very suspicious.

01:13.280 --> 01:15.310
It's trying to shake our mentality.

01:17.020 --> 01:18.670
Let's get going.

01:18.670 --> 01:21.400
Let's go play this labyrinth
of no return game.

01:50.420 --> 01:52.090
GODS' GAME WE PLAY

01:53.470 --> 01:58.720
GODS' GAME WE PLAY

02:52.650 --> 02:56.570
PLAYER.11: THE LABYRINTH
OF NO RETURN, RUSHEIMARE

02:57.460 --> 03:00.910
Tutorial finished.
Good work, everyone.

03:00.910 --> 03:04.180
I am Meep, and I'm going
to explain the game to you.

03:04.570 --> 03:08.060
Did you get a feel for the game?

03:08.060 --> 03:10.190
Well, yeah...

03:10.190 --> 03:12.460
Is this where the real labyrinth begins?

03:12.460 --> 03:16.580
Yes, this is the divine
labyrinth of Rusheimare.

03:16.580 --> 03:20.090
You have already experienced respawning,

03:20.090 --> 03:22.290
but no matter how many times
you are wiped out,

03:22.290 --> 03:24.710
you will have to try again from here.

03:24.710 --> 03:29.270
In this game, you must defeat the last boss
at the deepest level to clear the labyrinth.

03:29.630 --> 03:32.230
The labyrinth is filled
with various monsters,

03:32.230 --> 03:35.230
gimmicks, and traps.

03:35.640 --> 03:38.200
There are items to help you
conquer the labyrinth.

03:38.920 --> 03:40.650
You can craft a higher-rarity item

03:40.650 --> 03:43.200
by fusing two or more items together.

03:46.250 --> 03:49.130
The maximum number of items
you can have is two.

03:49.680 --> 03:52.430
If someone in your team dies,

03:52.430 --> 03:56.130
you will respawn, and you will lose
the items you have acquired.

03:56.130 --> 03:57.290
RESPAWN
The bosses and the traps

03:57.290 --> 03:59.390
RESPAWN
you have conquered will be reset.

03:59.390 --> 04:02.100
Do we have to start all
over again once we die?

04:02.100 --> 04:03.220
No.

04:03.220 --> 04:07.440
The knowledge you have gained
will not be lost, and it will carry on.

04:07.440 --> 04:10.310
The release value above
your head will also remain.

04:13.030 --> 04:13.520
This number will rise to 100%

04:13.520 --> 04:16.160
RELEASE VALUE:
This number will rise to 100%

04:16.160 --> 04:18.340
INCREASED WHEN CONQUERING LABYRINTH
when you conquer the gimmicks in the labyrinth.

04:18.340 --> 04:21.200
0~100%
It's a challenging element for the maniacs.

04:21.200 --> 04:23.530
Now, do you have any questions?

04:23.900 --> 04:25.720
Tell us how to return to the real world.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.500
Alright.

04:26.500 --> 04:30.070
The first is that you must clear
this game by defeating the last boss.

04:30.070 --> 04:32.880
The second is to acquire saved items.

04:32.880 --> 04:35.560
You can return to
the human world while keeping

04:35.560 --> 04:37.870
the items and gimmicks.

04:37.870 --> 04:40.380
Do you have any other information?

04:40.380 --> 04:45.020
Now, I will tell you a legend
about this labyrinth!

04:46.390 --> 04:51.050
Once upon a time, there was a god who was
very enthusiastic about building a labyrinth.

04:51.050 --> 04:55.280
And she was waiting excitedly at the far end
of the labyrinth for humans to come.

04:56.460 --> 04:59.830
However, no one conquered the labyrinth,

04:59.830 --> 05:04.030
and the god died of boredom.

05:04.030 --> 05:05.400
And that's the end.

05:05.790 --> 05:08.910
She died? Even though she is god?!

05:08.910 --> 05:14.230
Yes. However, the dungeon of the God Lord
remains as splendid as it was.

05:14.230 --> 05:17.880
Please enjoy the game
without any worries.

05:18.220 --> 05:22.730
Now, let the game of great adventure
in the labyrinth of Rusheimare begin!

05:24.890 --> 05:26.040
ELEMENTS
RUSHEIMARE OF DEATH AND REBIRTH

05:26.040 --> 05:26.660
VS. LORD OF THE UNDERWORLD (???)

05:26.660 --> 05:27.200
DEATH. CAN ONLY SURVIVE
BECAUSE OF THE GAME

05:27.200 --> 05:27.810
GAME START

05:30.670 --> 05:32.440
Wow, this is wonderful.

05:32.440 --> 05:35.730
That god really committed
to creating this labyrinth.

05:36.380 --> 05:38.690
There are no traps, are there?

05:45.780 --> 05:47.520
Is that Puff?!

05:47.520 --> 05:48.700
Do you know it?

05:48.700 --> 05:50.940
No! But this squeak,

05:50.940 --> 05:52.710
and its lovely appearance!

05:52.710 --> 05:56.670
No matter how you look at it, there is
no other way but to name it "Puff"!

06:03.320 --> 06:05.150
S-Stop...

06:05.150 --> 06:07.960
Huh? It doesn't hurt.

06:13.000 --> 06:15.230
It's really soft, like a cushion.

06:23.060 --> 06:24.860
Huh? These are...

06:25.870 --> 06:27.150
CRAFT: 2 WOODEN PLANKS -> WOODEN SHIELD
Yes.

06:27.150 --> 06:28.330
DO YOU WANT TO CRAFT IT?

06:33.730 --> 06:36.440
Woah, I created a wooden shield!

06:36.440 --> 06:38.880
And the points increased too.
This is a win-win.

06:38.880 --> 06:42.020
So crafting items
is one of this game's gimmicks.

06:42.020 --> 06:43.870
It's really worth doing.

06:47.260 --> 06:49.120
This game is kind of easy.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.770
Well, it's going very well...

06:54.940 --> 06:56.480
Is that a rare Puff?!

06:56.790 --> 07:00.450
Catch it, Pearl!
That must be a good item!

07:00.450 --> 07:01.440
Roger!

07:01.800 --> 07:04.260
Come on, don't scare.

07:04.260 --> 07:06.260
I'll give you a pat.

07:11.040 --> 07:11.580
Eh?

07:16.540 --> 07:18.250
ALL MEMBERS RECEIVED 9999 DAMAGE
FROM GOLDEN PUFF'S GOD'S BREATH.

07:18.250 --> 07:19.000
FAY AND THE OTHERS ARE WIPED OUT.

07:19.700 --> 07:22.970
Now, let the great adventure begin!

07:23.410 --> 07:24.420
Excuse me?

07:24.980 --> 07:27.050
Ah, I see.

07:27.050 --> 07:28.930
It was this kind of game, huh?

07:28.930 --> 07:30.050
What a pity...

07:30.050 --> 07:32.300
We've been wiped out instantly.

07:32.300 --> 07:35.650
This game is the ultimate
"dungeon of death," so to speak.

07:35.650 --> 07:38.770
I felt a strange sense of weakness
when I was walking around earlier.

07:39.250 --> 07:41.640
Since we chose the "PMD" difficulty level,

07:41.640 --> 07:44.240
the strength was capped as well.

07:44.620 --> 07:47.110
And now god's lens is broken.

07:47.900 --> 07:51.340
Now we're part of the apostles
who can't return.

07:51.340 --> 07:54.510
We've become mummies
among the mummies!

07:54.510 --> 07:56.960
We've got to conquer
this game sooner.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.140
Let's try again.

07:58.830 --> 08:02.830
I have a feeling that
Golden Puff is the area boss.

08:02.830 --> 08:05.720
So that means it's a good idea
to beat it and then move forward.

08:06.060 --> 08:07.170
For example?

08:07.170 --> 08:08.430
Well, let's see...

08:10.220 --> 08:14.140
We take the Brown Puff alive
and hold it as a hostage.

08:18.570 --> 08:21.080
And then we'll ask them to surrender.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.070
What a method...

08:23.070 --> 08:25.070
You three, stay back.

08:25.070 --> 08:25.900
Huh?

08:28.770 --> 08:29.740
It comes!

08:37.460 --> 08:39.300
Moment Reversal!

08:39.750 --> 08:41.460
Eat this!

08:58.070 --> 08:59.880
This is a key!

08:59.880 --> 09:01.980
It should open a door somewhere!

09:02.500 --> 09:03.990
As expected of you, Nel!

09:05.220 --> 09:06.980
I just did what I had to do.

09:07.560 --> 09:10.070
Come on, I'll take the lead.

09:12.910 --> 09:15.870
Now, let the great adventure begin!

09:18.060 --> 09:20.040
I'm really sorry!

09:20.040 --> 09:24.200
This is the kind of game that gets
into the crevices of your mind.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.500
We let our guard down
after you beat the boss.

09:26.500 --> 09:28.060
Say, Meep...

09:28.060 --> 09:31.470
We beat Golden Puff,
but if we respawned, then...

09:31.810 --> 09:35.180
Then all the monsters and traps
were reset.

09:35.550 --> 09:37.770
I'm really sorry!

09:37.770 --> 09:40.350
It's okay, Nel!

09:40.350 --> 09:44.980
In other words, we must clear this
labyrinth without making a mistake.

09:46.920 --> 09:49.320
Okay, let's promise one thing.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.940
The thing we shouldn't do in this game

09:51.940 --> 09:54.530
is make mistakes and hurt your friends.

09:55.030 --> 09:57.540
No matter who makes a mistake,
just say, "Don't worry."

09:58.310 --> 10:01.250
We can turn any failure
into an experience.

10:01.730 --> 10:03.190
So let's go.

10:03.190 --> 10:05.580
Let's make a lot of mistakes now so that

10:05.580 --> 10:07.360
we can clear the game with no mistakes.

10:08.000 --> 10:11.010
UNDEFEATED
GODS' GAME WE PLAY

10:13.560 --> 10:16.100
If we look into their eyes, it'll go berserk!

10:16.100 --> 10:17.500
Our Arise doesn't work!

10:17.500 --> 10:19.180
Items won't work either!

10:19.180 --> 10:23.420
How are we supposed to
beat this monster?!

10:23.980 --> 10:27.940
Ta-dah! I crafted a mirror shield!

10:28.260 --> 10:30.490
But what is it used for?

10:30.490 --> 10:32.050
A mirror, huh?

10:32.050 --> 10:36.220
Maybe it's useful to repel the gaze of
monsters that cast spells with their eyes.

10:36.660 --> 10:39.910
Will it become so convenient?

10:39.910 --> 10:41.870
By the way, what have you crafted?

10:42.270 --> 10:44.330
I made an alarm clock.

10:44.330 --> 10:47.490
Huh? What effect does that have?

10:47.490 --> 10:49.270
ALARM CLOCK
It'll ring so loud,

10:49.270 --> 10:50.880
WILL RING LOUD.
and then the sleeping monsters nearby

10:50.880 --> 10:52.020
SLEEPING MONSTERS NEARBY
will attack you.

10:52.020 --> 10:54.050
WILL AWAKEN AND ATTACK YOU.
Then we shouldn't use it!

10:54.050 --> 10:56.780
Well, since this is what I have,
I'll keep it.

10:57.430 --> 10:59.500
With my "wake-up trumpet,"

10:59.500 --> 11:02.350
I can wake up monsters in the large range!

11:02.350 --> 11:03.680
I'll blow it to try it out...

11:03.680 --> 11:05.690
Don't try it!

11:07.550 --> 11:10.980
With wood and vinyl,
I made a "mere umbrella."

11:10.980 --> 11:11.530
MERE UMBRELLA

11:11.530 --> 11:12.410
YOU CAN USE IT WHEN IT RAINS OR SNOWS
I crafted it,

11:12.410 --> 11:14.000
YOU CAN USE IT WHEN IT RAINS OR SNOWS
hoping it would have a hidden effect,

11:14.000 --> 11:16.110
YOU CAN USE IT WHEN IT RAINS OR SNOWS
but it really is just a normal umbrella.

11:16.480 --> 11:18.490
Well, let's just keep it up.

11:21.630 --> 11:24.710
We haven't been in that area yet.

11:24.710 --> 11:26.530
Stay alert, everyone.

11:27.070 --> 11:28.360
Is it a monster?

11:28.360 --> 11:30.950
Shh. These are human footsteps.

11:33.210 --> 11:35.260
Captain Ashlan, I heard voices...

11:35.650 --> 11:39.360
Be on your guard!
This labyrinth is full of traps.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.720
Senior?

11:42.260 --> 11:43.450
Are my eyes tired?

11:43.770 --> 11:46.140
My junior's right in front of me.

11:46.140 --> 11:48.620
Is it a fake monster in disguise?

11:48.620 --> 11:50.230
I'm the real one, though.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.920
So you're the real one!

11:52.920 --> 11:54.570
It's been a while since then!

11:54.570 --> 11:55.820
It's good to see you.

11:56.420 --> 11:59.260
Let's exchange information about
how to conquer this labyrinth.

12:00.680 --> 12:04.970
Since each respawn point is different,
let's decide where to meet up.

12:04.970 --> 12:06.090
I agreed.

12:06.090 --> 12:09.000
Senior, do you have any idea
where the save point is?

12:09.440 --> 12:13.500
I think it was in a locked room
at the back of this place.

12:13.920 --> 12:17.970
I have one key,
but I'm missing one more.

12:18.400 --> 12:20.470
Could it be this one?

12:20.470 --> 12:21.930
That's it!

12:22.870 --> 12:23.260
Hup!

12:29.990 --> 12:30.830
GOLD KEY PIECE + SILVER KEY PIECE
Execution site?

12:30.830 --> 12:31.730
KEY TO THE EXECUTION SITE HAS BEEN CREATED
Execution site?

12:31.730 --> 12:33.810
All right, it's done!

12:33.810 --> 12:35.940
Let's move on, guys!

12:37.950 --> 12:39.410
Fay, this is the place.

12:39.760 --> 12:42.640
I really have a bad feeling about this!

12:43.030 --> 12:44.550
In a situation like this,

12:45.970 --> 12:47.530
we'll use the 'purification bell.'

12:47.530 --> 12:49.960
It makes a sound if a monster is nearby.

12:50.930 --> 12:51.940
In addition,

12:52.920 --> 12:55.790
with the 'clairvoyance glasses,'
we can detect any traps.

12:55.790 --> 12:58.880
And now neither of them reacts.
Do you know what that means?

12:58.880 --> 13:02.590
Is this execution site just a bluff
to scare players?

13:02.590 --> 13:04.260
That's right.

13:19.100 --> 13:21.490
Captain, there aren't any traps.

13:21.490 --> 13:23.820
My bell isn't responding either.

13:23.820 --> 13:25.300
But this is odd.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.550
Why is there nothing here?

13:27.550 --> 13:29.040
Not even a treasure chest.

13:30.540 --> 13:31.930
What are you doing?

13:31.930 --> 13:33.470
Checking for gimmicks.

13:33.470 --> 13:35.460
I'm looking for hidden switches or something.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.330
But it's right in front of us.

13:38.330 --> 13:39.170
Huh?

13:39.170 --> 13:41.550
What? Did I do something?

13:41.550 --> 13:44.760
No, that's not it.
There's another presence right there.

13:46.450 --> 13:47.580
Master Fay.

13:47.580 --> 13:50.930
It's very faint,
but I hear something like an exhale.

13:50.930 --> 13:51.600
What?

13:51.910 --> 13:54.150
Is this a sleeping breath?

13:55.770 --> 14:00.240
Right now, I feel a warm wind blowing
from there on my neck!

14:00.240 --> 14:01.030
What?!

14:01.530 --> 14:03.740
Even though it's an enclosed space,

14:03.740 --> 14:05.740
and there are candle flames?

14:06.210 --> 14:09.310
With all this circumstantial evidence,
I can only assume...

14:10.600 --> 14:11.500
Senior!

14:11.810 --> 14:13.480
Perhaps there is a raid boss!

14:13.480 --> 14:15.710
Then why isn't the bell responding?!

14:16.040 --> 14:17.350
What if the boss is sleeping?

14:17.350 --> 14:18.170
What?

14:18.170 --> 14:22.160
If this exhale is from an invisible monster,
that would explain it.

14:22.160 --> 14:25.890
So does that mean that to fight this one,
we have to wake it up first?

14:25.890 --> 14:27.730
That's it, Captain!

14:27.730 --> 14:30.310
We have an 'alarm clock'
and a 'wake-up trumpet'!

14:30.630 --> 14:32.210
Let's give it a try.

14:32.210 --> 14:34.900
I'll try to make a loud noise!

14:34.900 --> 14:36.790
Everyone, get back!

14:36.790 --> 14:37.960
Hey, hey...

14:38.360 --> 14:39.750
Let's do this, Leshea!

14:39.750 --> 14:40.820
Yeah!

14:54.120 --> 14:54.960
THE SLEEPING LION'S RAGE ARTS

14:54.960 --> 14:55.780
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM THE HEAVENS

14:55.780 --> 14:56.600
TO PERISH ALL PLAYERS

14:56.600 --> 14:58.840
THE PLAYERS PERISHED

14:59.320 --> 15:02.260
Now, let the great adventure begin!

15:03.170 --> 15:03.930
Yes?

15:04.720 --> 15:05.980
What was that?!

15:05.980 --> 15:07.550
I didn't see any damage or anything,

15:07.550 --> 15:11.060
but a message that said 'perish'
I've never seen before!

15:11.060 --> 15:14.090
Well, our attempt is making progress.

15:14.090 --> 15:15.320
Let's try it one more time.

15:15.320 --> 15:17.190
But that boss...

15:17.190 --> 15:19.520
Maybe we should consult with seniors.

15:19.520 --> 15:21.630
He's been playing longer than us,

15:21.630 --> 15:24.270
and he might have an item
that can counter that attack.

15:27.550 --> 15:29.280
Shield of Magic Reflection!

15:29.820 --> 15:34.600
Our analysis says that
the Sleeping Lion's Rage Arts are magical.

15:34.600 --> 15:37.250
So this shield will work to counter it.

15:37.670 --> 15:39.710
I prepared enough for everyone.

15:39.710 --> 15:44.200
I don't know what the sleeping lion is,
but let's show them the wisdom of humans.

15:46.130 --> 15:47.770
Fay, do it!

15:47.770 --> 15:49.300
Well, let's get to it!

15:55.430 --> 15:56.230
THE SLEEPING LION'S RAGE ARTS

15:56.230 --> 15:57.100
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM THE HEAVENS

15:57.100 --> 15:57.900
TO PERISH ALL PLAYERS

15:57.900 --> 15:59.860
THE PLAYERS PERISHED

15:59.860 --> 16:03.070
Now, let the great adventure begin!

16:03.380 --> 16:06.030
I'm tired of hearing that!

16:06.030 --> 16:06.530
ONE MORE ATTEMPT

16:07.030 --> 16:07.530
ONE MORE ATTEMPT

16:08.030 --> 16:08.530
ONE MORE ATTEMPT

16:10.170 --> 16:11.450
We're back again!

16:11.450 --> 16:13.910
We're really screwed with this difficulty!

16:13.910 --> 16:16.700
How can that attack go through
the magic reflection?!

16:16.700 --> 16:17.860
Nel,

16:17.860 --> 16:21.630
can you bounce back that attack like you
kicked back the Golden Puff's attack?

16:21.960 --> 16:24.640
If that "descends from
the heavens" were true,

16:24.640 --> 16:27.210
then that attack should
have come from above.

16:29.930 --> 16:30.980
I'll wake it up.

16:30.980 --> 16:32.300
Y-Yes.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.760
I'm always ready.

16:41.310 --> 16:41.930
THE SLEEPING LION'S RAGE ARTS

16:41.930 --> 16:42.500
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM THE HEAVENS

16:42.500 --> 16:43.020
TO PERISH ALL PLAYERS

16:43.020 --> 16:45.230
THE PLAYERS PERISHED

16:45.230 --> 16:47.690
Let the great adventure begin!

16:49.150 --> 16:51.110
I'm really sorry!

16:51.620 --> 16:53.580
But one thing I realized

16:53.950 --> 16:57.160
is that that attack was a meteorite
that rained down thousands of shots.

16:57.500 --> 17:01.200
I could only kick back
about 1% of them...

17:03.460 --> 17:05.050
I want go home...

17:05.050 --> 17:08.360
It's like we're running out of ideas.

17:09.010 --> 17:09.560
THE SLEEPING LION'S RAGE ARTS

17:09.560 --> 17:10.300
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM THE HEAVENS

17:10.300 --> 17:10.970
TO PERISH ALL PLAYERS

17:10.970 --> 17:13.770
THE PLAYERS PERISHED
The "player perished" message

17:13.770 --> 17:15.930
THE PLAYERS PERISHED
is written in a very emphatic way.

17:15.930 --> 17:16.470
THE PLAYERS PERISHED
Huh?

17:16.830 --> 17:19.880
That attack should have no effect
on anyone but the player.

17:20.320 --> 17:23.540
Nel kicked it back,
but the Sleeping Lion was safe.

17:24.110 --> 17:24.540
ALL PLAYERS EXCEPT NEL PERISHED

17:24.540 --> 17:25.820
ALL PLAYERS EXCEPT NEL PERISHED
That's right.

17:26.190 --> 17:29.300
I was able to kick back the attack
from Golden Puff and defeat it,

17:29.300 --> 17:31.410
but not the Sleeping Lion!

17:31.410 --> 17:32.540
In other words,

17:32.540 --> 17:36.260
something other than the player
should prevent the falling meteorite.

17:36.260 --> 17:37.420
For example...

17:41.290 --> 17:41.830
A MERE UMBRELLA

17:41.830 --> 17:44.310
YOU CAN USE IT WHEN IT RAINS OR SNOWS
Ah! This item!

17:44.310 --> 17:44.790
YOU CAN USE IT WHEN IT RAINS OR SNOWS

17:53.430 --> 17:54.080
THE SLEEPING LION'S RAGE ARTS

17:54.080 --> 17:54.640
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM THE HEAVENS

17:54.640 --> 17:55.300
TO PERISH ALL PLAYERS

17:55.300 --> 17:57.720
THE PLAYERS DID NOT PERISH

17:57.720 --> 18:01.180
Hell, yeah! We endured it!

18:01.630 --> 18:04.650
Not yet! We're not done yet!

18:08.280 --> 18:09.230
It's huge!

18:09.230 --> 18:10.470
You guys, get back!

18:10.470 --> 18:12.900
If one of you gets hit,
we'll get respawned!

18:18.540 --> 18:19.940
One damage?!

18:19.940 --> 18:23.460
Oh, no! I'm so weak now!

18:24.460 --> 18:25.920
Come on, you guys!

18:32.090 --> 18:35.710
Hey! Why does your attack
only deal 1 damage too?!

18:35.710 --> 18:37.300
Its remaining lives have appeared!

18:37.300 --> 18:40.530
THE SLEEPING LION
2.497.301 lives left!

18:40.530 --> 18:41.770
THE SLEEPING LION
At this rate,

18:41.770 --> 18:43.690
we won't be able to kill it in 10 years!

18:43.690 --> 18:46.230
What's going on with this difficulty level?!

18:47.020 --> 18:49.480
THE SWING OF THE SLEEPING LION.
IT'LL DESTROY ALL TARGETS ON THE GROUND.

18:49.480 --> 18:51.190
Oh, no! Everybody, jump!

18:55.740 --> 18:58.700
Damn it! It still has such
a foul attack like this!

18:58.700 --> 19:00.910
N-No, it's working!

19:00.910 --> 19:01.440
THE SLEEPING LION
N-No, it's working!

19:01.440 --> 19:05.250
THE SLEEPING LION
1.785.789 lives remain!

19:05.820 --> 19:07.310
I get it now!

19:07.310 --> 19:10.080
Since the attack is
'all targets on the ground,'

19:10.080 --> 19:11.960
that monster took the damage too!

19:12.480 --> 19:15.680
It's an endurance battle!
We'll provoke that monster's attack!

19:15.680 --> 19:19.810
You guys! When it attacks back,
we all jump together!

19:25.710 --> 19:27.150
Here it comes! Jump!

19:29.740 --> 19:33.320
1.490.311 lives remain!

19:33.320 --> 19:35.530
THE SLEEPING LION
Seven more tries!

19:35.530 --> 19:37.230
Get steady, guys!

19:37.230 --> 19:39.490
Think of it as ten-person-long jump ropes!

20:01.560 --> 20:04.050
THE SLEEPING LION
598 lives remain!

20:04.050 --> 20:07.020
THE SLEEPING LION
One more jump, and it'll run out of lives!

20:09.690 --> 20:11.150
This is the last one!

20:12.070 --> 20:12.820
Saki!

20:12.820 --> 20:14.780
Get out of the way!

20:15.470 --> 20:17.700
You don't have to swing anymore!

20:22.870 --> 20:26.160
Go back to sleep again!

20:40.380 --> 20:41.850
Hell, yeah!

20:42.430 --> 20:43.640
That was close!

20:43.640 --> 20:44.810
BELL OF RESURRECTION
We did it!

20:44.810 --> 20:46.340
Nel!

20:47.760 --> 20:49.440
P-Pearl?!

20:49.840 --> 20:52.470
I can't believe you kicked back
the last attack!

20:52.470 --> 20:55.190
Normally, I wouldn't think
you could do that!

20:56.050 --> 20:59.680
I was so absorbed,
so I couldn't remember much.

20:59.680 --> 21:03.160
Even if you don't remember,
there is a winning item here!

21:03.160 --> 21:05.790
This is the item that you should have.

21:07.870 --> 21:10.230
The "Bell of Resurrection"?

21:10.230 --> 21:13.290
From the name,
can it revive a fallen player?

21:13.290 --> 21:15.500
Don't ring that bell! It's a trap!

21:15.900 --> 21:16.820
Huh?

21:21.910 --> 21:23.850
W-Why?!

21:23.850 --> 21:26.390
It's the effect of the bell that revived it!

21:26.390 --> 21:30.100
The boss is fully revived!
It had 2.500.000 lives!

21:30.100 --> 21:32.900
This dungeon does not really make sense!

21:32.900 --> 21:35.310
I'm really sorry!

21:35.310 --> 21:37.030
Found you, humans.

21:38.990 --> 21:40.710
I am here!

21:42.320 --> 21:44.450
I won this hide-and-seek!

21:44.450 --> 21:46.630
Last time, I let my guard down and lost,

21:46.630 --> 21:49.760
but I let Bookmaker erase my one loss.

21:49.760 --> 21:51.920
So I'm still undefeated!

21:52.500 --> 21:55.420
Uh, who are you?

21:55.420 --> 21:59.710
Huh? Don't tell me you've forgotten
the undefeated god!

21:59.710 --> 22:02.760
This voice... Uroboros?!

22:02.760 --> 22:05.600
I told you to play with me again,
but you never showed up.

22:05.600 --> 22:07.310
I'm so bored...

22:09.430 --> 22:10.330
Oh, no!

22:10.330 --> 22:11.890
We don't have any umbrellas left!

22:12.800 --> 22:13.560
You're so noisy.

22:16.310 --> 22:18.020
THE SLEEPING LION RECEIVED
8.799.000.300.000.199 DAMAGE

22:22.350 --> 22:26.160
Geez. I'm still talking,
you small puppy.
